> Does anyone know if there's an *actual* problem with it, as such?  If
> so, what?

simple-tense-modal thingies need to be connected with logical
connectives;  you can just list them.  Xorxes eschews this rule
deliberately, IIRC.

Proper grammar is {mo'ini'a je mo'ini'a je mo'ini'a}.

